  "locale:15723 [npc_dialog | - | Flitter] 'Have you seen that postman, Flitter? I ordered some new clothes but he is always so late with his deliveries. I wish he would hurry up! I am going to complain t'",
  "locale:15725 [npc_dialog | - | May] 'Ignore my sis, May. She is a bit spoiled. All it takes to make me happy is a pizza with extra mushrooms.'",
  "locale:15727 [npc_dialog | - | Nuts and Bolts] \"Welcome to Nuts and Bolts! Today's special is a fizamagong. What does it do? I don't know, but I am sure it is really useful.\"",
  "locale:15729 [npc_dialog | - | Jacque's Cafe] \"Yes this is Jacque's Cafe. You can seat yourself. I am on a break.<BR><BR>Oh, and remember to tip me well. I don't work here for my health.\"",
  "locale:15731 [npc_dialog | - | -] 'Sooo tired. I am in the middle of a twenty hour shift. I just wish I could sleep but I never know when I will need to airlift someone to the hospital.'",
  "locale:15733 [npc_dialog | Sanctuary | -] 'Welcome to Sanctuary. If you see any honey thieves, make sure to return their stolen honey to me so I can eat... I mean return it to the bixies.'",
  "locale:15739 [npc_dialog | - | Air Pixies] \"Have you heard of those new shoes called Air Pixies? I wish I could afford some, but being a royal guard doesn't pay as much as you think it would.\"",
  "locale:15741 [npc_dialog | Sanctuary | Jacque's Cafe] \"Welcome to Sanctuary. Make sure to stop by Jacque's Cafe and try the Floren Fishcakes. They are the best!\"",
  "locale:15743 [npc_dialog | Sanctuary | the Queen] \"Yeah, I know you're important, but unless you have a royal summons you cannot see the Queen.\"",
  "locale:15745 [npc_dialog | - | pixie lands ambassador] 'Bah. It is too happy here for my taste. Why do I have to be the ambassador to the pixie lands? I think I would rather deal with the trolls.'",
  "locale:15747 [npc_dialog | - | Merry Vale] 'Have you ever been to Merry Vale? Have you, have you??! It is the most wonderful place in the whole world! You should go when you have time! That is where I am '",
  "locale:15749 [npc_dialog | Sanctuary | the Queen] 'I need to speak with the Queen, but I am number 100 in line and they are only on number 5 right now.'",
  "locale:15755 [quest_dialog | - | -] 'You have done well! '",
  "locale:15757 [quest_dialog | - | -] 'There is a little problem...we cannot have anyone knowing that we let this place get overrun...'",
  "locale:15759 [quest_dialog | - | -] 'I know I will not tell anyone, but to make sure you do not... Guards!!!'",
  "locale:15762 [npc_dialog | - | guard] 'Sorry, but I cannot let you through. Move along.'",
  "locale:15764 [npc_dialog | - | pet shop] 'I have both cats and dogs for sale. I prefer dogs myself. They are just so cute!'",
  "locale:15766 [npc_dialog | - | pet shop] 'Shop is closed bzzz. Bzzz back later.'",
  "locale:15768 [npc_dialog | - | paint shop] 'Hello. I am all out of paint at the moment, but I will hopefully have a full range of colors available in the future.'",
  "locale:15770 [npc_dialog | - | housing decorations shop] 'I am still getting my shop set up, but someday everyone will come to me for the best housing decorations in the world.'",
  "locale:15772 [npc_dialog | - | blush] \"Does this Chugawug Yellow blush I have on look ok? I don't know why my customers buy it. Seems a bit tacky to me.\"",
  "locale:15774 [npc_dialog | - | Rose/Violet] 'I am not Rose. I am Violet!'",
  "locale:15776 [npc_dialog | - | Rose/Violet] 'I am not Violet. I am Rose!'",
  "locale:15778 [npc_dialog | Pixiely Hills | honey seller] \"Fresh honey for sale! Well I don't actually have any right now. I ate it all. Aren't bixies the greatest? They make my favorite food after all.\"",
  "locale:15780 [npc_dialog | Pixiely Hills | Dainty Feet] \"Welcome to Dainty Feet. We have the hottest new shoes in Pixiely Hills; Air Pixies in stock now. I don't think you can afford those however.\""
