{
 "title": "dialog 441680-441729",
 "lines_to_bind": [
  "locale:441680 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Spray and Play] 'Brilliantly done! We used to use the spray to keep the bixies out of town, but lately we have had to use more and more to try to keep our citizens safe.<BR><BR>'",
  "locale:441684 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Et Tu, Buzzuz?] 'It is good to hear of the defeat of their lieutenant! That should leave their forces in disarray until they regroup.<BR><BR>Luckily, we received word of a large'",
  "locale:441685 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Into the Hive] 'We now know the location of the Bixie Hive! If we are able to confront the Bixie Queen, we may be able to find out why the bixies have been so restless!<BR><BR>'",
  "locale:441688 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Into the Hive] 'The Bixie Queen was captured by Drone Fauzz and his forces? Perhaps his defeat will even make things more civil with the hive.'",
  "locale:441689 [quest_dialog | Greenwood | Military Intelligence] 'We refer to chugawugs that have turned to a life of crime as Thugawugs - and boy do we have a lot of them around here!<BR><BR>Two of my scouts are dedicated to '",
  "locale:441692 [quest_dialog | Greenwood | Military Intelligence] \"It's good to know that both of my scouts are alive and well.<BR><BR>Thanks retrieving the reports. Hopefully they contain good news!\"",
  "locale:441696 [quest_dialog | - | Thugawhomp] \"Good job pushing them back, but they won't stay away for long!<BR><BR>I wish I knew what they were planning!\"",
  "locale:441700 [quest_dialog | - | Scouting the Stompers] \"Good job on getting these reports! Let's see what these say!<BR><BR>Hmm… Well that's not good!\"",
  "locale:441701 [quest_dialog | - | Scouting the Stompers] \"The documents that you retrieved suggest that the bandits are moving - and soon!<BR><BR>I can't see any way around it. You need to infiltrate the <font color='D\"",
  "locale:441704 [quest_dialog | - | Searching the Hideout] \"Excellent work on defeating the bandit leader! Unfortunately it sounds like we haven't won this yet!\"",
  "locale:441708 [quest_dialog | - | Jojo A-go-go] 'While you were defeating the leaders of the Thugawug bandits, my scouts returned to me with some information that may help you find your missing caravan members'",
  "locale:441709 [quest_dialog | Greenwood Forest | Jojo A-go-go] 'My son, Jojo, knows more about ninjas than anyone else I know. Talk to him and give him this package so he knows I sent you.<BR><BR>He is currently attending th'",
  "locale:441712 [quest_dialog | - | Jojo A-go-go] \"A package from my dad? Awesome! I bet I know what it is...<BR><BR>Hey everyone! Check out the sweet <font color='D9781A'>NINJA COSTUME</font> my dad sent me!\"",
  "locale:441713 [quest_dialog | Summer Camp | Jojo's Mojo] \"As you can probably tell, I'm totally into ninjas. In fact, with your help, I can become one!<BR><BR>First I need some mystical mojo. You can get some from the \"",
  "locale:441716 [quest_dialog | Summer Camp | Jojo's Mojo] \"My mojo! I can already feel it working! Oh man, you're the best!<BR><BR>Now we need work on our ninja training!\"",
  "locale:441717 [quest_dialog | Summer Camp | Jojo's Dojo] \"Training to be a ninja is hard work and requires intense training. Unfortunately I don't have a good obstacle course.<BR><BR>Hey! I bet that ninja camp over the\"",
  "locale:441720 [quest_dialog | Summer Camp | Jojo's Dojo] \"This is going to be so totally awesome! I can't wait to start training so I can become a real ninja!<BR><BR>Don't worry, I'm going to start training as soon as \"",
  "locale:441721 [quest_dialog | Danger Peaks | Jojo's Ninjato] \"When a trainee receives their ninja sword, that's the moment they become a real ninja!<BR><BR>So I want you to get one for me from the ninjas on top of Danger P\"",
  "locale:441724 [quest_dialog | Danger Peaks | Dojo Mojo] 'Being a ninja is going to be the best! But with great power comes great responsibility, grasshopper!<BR><BR>...I heard that somewhere.'",
  "locale:441725 [quest_dialog | Danger Peaks | Dojo Mojo] \"So, um, it turns out that Taka was actually the only one keeping all of these ninja under control. Without him they're all following Jintaka. And that guy is NO\"",
  "locale:441728 [quest_dialog | Merry Vale | The Mystery Caravan] 'Jintaka is down for the count? Whew. Who knew this ninja stuff was such hard work?<BR><BR>By the way, when you were away dealing with the sensei, I spoke with T'",
  "locale:441729 [quest_dialog | Merry Vale | The Mystery Caravan] \"What people don't know is that all of these disapperances, not just the ones you mentioned, are happening to people who had just visited Merry Vale.<BR><BR>We s\""
 ],
 "context_before": [
  "locale:441669 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Bixie Skirmish] \"Your timing is perfect, [*player*]!<br><br>Please <font color='D9781A'>fight off the remaining Bixie Soldiers</font> before they attack again. I fear their next\"",
  "locale:441670 [quest_title | Sanctuary | Bixie Skirmish] 'Bixie Skirmish'",
  "locale:441671 [quest_objective | Sanctuary | Bixie Skirmish] 'Sergeant Larkspur, an injured royal guard posted just outside of Sanctuary, needs you to defend the city by defeating Bixie Soliders.'",
  "locale:441672 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Bixie Skirmish] 'Those cowardly bixies will surely think twice before attacking us again, eh, [*player*]!<BR><BR>Now we can turn our attention to finding out what happened to ou'",
  "locale:441673 [quest_objective | Sanctuary | Bixie Skirmish] \"Our caravan of <font color='D9781A'>Bixie-B-Gone bixie repellant</font> from Merry Vale should have arrived by now. I fear the worst with these recent bixie att\"",
  "locale:441674 [item | - | Bixie-B-Gone] 'Bixie-B-Gone'"
 ],
 "context_after": [
  "locale:441735 [quest_objective | Merry Vale | Confront the Cultists] 'Shaggy Mysterychaser, an amateur detective in Merry Vale, needs me to help him investigate the cave in the north part of town.'",
  "locale:441736 [quest_dialog | Merry Vale | Confront the Cultists] \"Those robed fairies didn't tell you anything, did they?<BR><BR>They have to be up to something! Why else would they attack for no reason?\"",
  "locale:441737 [quest_dialog | Merry Vale | Secrets of the Den] \"Deep in the cultists' cave is an area that is more protected than the rest. It's a den -<BR><BR>A DEN OF SECRETS!<BR><BR>Sneak into the cultist Den of Secrets a\"",
  "locale:441738 [quest_title | Merry Vale | Secrets of the Den] 'Secrets of the Den'",
  "locale:441739 [quest_objective | Merry Vale | Secrets of the Den] 'Shaggy Mysterychaser, an amateur detective in Merry Vale, needs me to explore the depths of the Den of Secrets in the back of the cave in northern Merry Vale.'",
  "locale:441740 [quest_dialog | Merry Vale | Mayor McFairy!] \"Mayor McFairy and his assistant Liana were involved? That… That is really boring! <BR><BR>It's so obvious, it might as well have been the butler that did it!\""
 ],
